/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86cf5f05-0be4-4fa8-8add-7c654a6710c0.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2026","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/8fdd274e-e689-4e74-ba10-2c44f2f6fadc.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/dead4381-5d03-4349-ab43-1c436de1e4eb.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/335b4165-cbcc-4ab1-b950-c0a9d08095fc.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/de54d064-598d-4ec5-8786-885594eb2125.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/543288/76049543288.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/543288/69857543288.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Deep Industries Limited reported robust financial and operational performance for FY26 and Q1 FY27, backed by strong execution across its onshore and offshore oil and gas service segments. Management highlighted supportive macroeconomic and policy tailwinds, including India's energy security focus, national schemes like Samudra Manthan and GOBARdhan, and growing domestic demand for natural gas infrastructure. The company expanded its order book, achieved significant year-on-year revenue and profitability growth, and continued pursuing strategic opportunities in higher-capacity drilling rigs and international offshore markets. Deep Industries Limited reported strong financial and operational performance for the first quarter ended June 30, 2026, achieving year-on-year growth in revenues, EBITDA, and PAT. Management highlighted supportive industry conditions, including domestic policy initiatives aimed at reducing import dependence and boosting exploration and production.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company entered offshore oil and gas support services in January 2023 by acquiring a 75 percent stake in Dolphin Offshore (Enterprises) India Limited via the IBC route.","quote":"In January 2023, Deep entered offshore oil & gas support services by acquiring a 75% stake in Dolphin Offshore (Enterprises) India Limited via the IBC route —itself listed on Indian exchanges —giving the group presence across both onshore and offshore.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=26901577-8aac-49e2-a2e0-5462ee776129.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that the dynamically-positioned DP2 barge owned by Beluga International DMCC, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Dolphin Offshore Enterprises (India) Ltd, has commenced revenue generation.","quote":"The dynamically-positioned DP2 barge, owned by Beluga International DMCC, Dubai —a wholly-owned subsidiary of Dolphin Offshore Enterprises (India) Ltd —has commenced revenue generation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=26901577-8aac-49e2-a2e0-5462ee776129.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA margin stood at 44.24% for FY26 compared to 43.35% for FY25.","quote":"EBITDA Margin (%) 44.24% 43.35% 89 bps","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=26901577-8aac-49e2-a2e0-5462ee776129.pdf"},{"claim":"Revenues in Q1 FY27 grew by 39.81% from Rs. 199.50 in Q1 FY26 to Rs. 278.92 in Q1 FY27.","quote":"Revenues in Q1FY 27 grew by 39.81% from Rs. 199.50 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 278.92 in Q1 FY 27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cc2552ea-9e6c-4a3d-a8a4-4baffbfabc6d.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA in Q1 FY27 grew by 38.73% from Rs. 95.02 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 131.83 in Q1 FY 27.","quote":"EBITDA in Q1 FY 27 grew by 38.73% from Rs. 95.02 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 131.83 in Q1 FY 27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cc2552ea-9e6c-4a3d-a8a4-4baffbfabc6d.pdf"},{"claim":"PAT in Q1 FY27 grew by 44.48% from Rs. 61.70 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 89.14 in Q1 FY 27.","quote":"PAT in Q1FY 27 grew by 44.48% from Rs.61.70 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 89.14 in Q1 FY 27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cc2552ea-9e6c-4a3d-a8a4-4baffbfabc6d.pdf"},{"claim":"Cash PAT in Q1 FY27 grew by 45.23% from Rs. 78.08 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 113.40 in Q1 FY 27.","quote":"Cash PAT in Q1FY 27 grew by 45.23% from Rs.78.08 in Q1 FY 26 to Rs. 113.40 in Q1 FY 27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cc2552ea-9e6c-4a3d-a8a4-4baffbfabc6d.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company owns more than 80 gas compressors.","quote":"Asset size: the Company owns more than 80 gas compressors","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=26901577-8aac-49e2-a2e0-5462ee776129.pdf"},{"claim":"The company's asset base includes 6 drilling rigs and 14 workover rigs.","quote":"6 Drilling Rigs 14 Workover Rigs Coring Services Air Drilling","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=26901577-8aac-49e2-a2e0-5462ee776129.pdf"},{"claim":"Deep secured a INR 1,402 crore, 15-year contract from ONGC to provide comprehensive services to boost production from one of its matured fields.","quote":"Deep has secured a ₹1,402 crore, 15-year contract from ONGC offering comprehensive services to boost production from one of ONGC's matured field